":"第26スライド","voiceDuration":6.555986394557823,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 26","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.026.jpeg","id":"756C64F2-5A24-404E-BBCB-367C41F412A7","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"八雲紫","duration":3.5,"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%85%AB%E9%9B%B2%E7%B4%AB","telop":"私がそういうと、彼女は戸を開け、入ってくる。","animationName":"バウンス"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_027_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","slideTitle":"第27スライド","voiceDuration":9.011995464852607,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 27","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.027.jpeg","id":"895328E3-B003-4299-8E69-EEB93C0D476C","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceCharacter":"にとり","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"にとり","duration":5.5,"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%81%AB%E3%81%A8%E3%82%8A","telop":"「紫様がおっしゃってた例の円球システムの乗っ取りは、一度解消され正常に戻りましたが、再び乗っ取られています。」","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_028_操夢.wav","slideTitle":"第28スライド","voiceDuration":5.823469387755102,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 28","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.028.jpeg","id":"0648FC24-1B29-4BA1-911A-92A3A5F5E7FE","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"八雲紫","duration":3.5,"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%85%AB%E9%9B%B2%E7%B4%AB","telop":"「どこから不正アクセスされてるの？」","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_029_古明地こいし.wav","slideTitle":"第29スライド","voiceDuration":6.516984126984127,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 29","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.029.jpeg","id":"776EE3B4-83EA-444E-93FB-A4FAFCACDA1F","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceCharacter":"にとり","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"にとり","duration":4,"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%81%AB%E3%81%A8%E3%82%8A","telop":"「今現在も、アクセス元を調べていますが、\nなかなか特定できない状況です。そこで…」","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_030_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","slideTitle":"第30スライド","voiceDuration":1.4561451247165533,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 30","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.030.jpeg","id":"A93A6FE9-5434-434F-B636-7A35767473B9","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceCharacter":"八雲紫","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"八雲紫","duration":5.300000000000001,"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%85%AB%E9%9B%B2%E7%B4%AB","telop":"私は、そこで唾を飲む。すると、彼女はヒソヒソとその内容を語った。それを聞いた私は、ある人物に電話をかけた。","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_031_操夢.wav","slideTitle":"第31スライド","voiceDuration":7.791950113378685,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 31","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.031.jpeg","id":"AA03454A-547B-4C08-BF29-BAEEA097DF46","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"操夢","duration":4.800000000000001,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"僕たちが、その画面…東京の某所カメラ映像を見ていると、\nそのカメラに映っている人物が電話をかける。","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_032_操夢.wav","slideTitle":"第32スライド","voiceDuration":4.169115646258503,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 32","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.032.jpeg","id":"DA4EA6B9-9E19-426E-9F2E-7EA121A67283","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"操夢","duration":3.5,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"すると、霊夢のポケットから音が鳴る。\n僕は、霊夢に目で合図を送る。","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_033_操夢.wav","slideTitle":"第33スライド","voiceDuration":6.234331065759637,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 33","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.033.jpeg","id":"695F7CA4-8DA1-4FF9-82D5-EFA79A1D7E1B","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"操夢","duration":5.9,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"そして、霊夢が部屋から出ていくと、僕はあるニュース記事を映し出す。そして、同時進行でシステムのコードを書き換えていく。","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_034_操夢.wav","slideTitle":"第34スライド","voiceDuration":4.143038548752834,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 34","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.034.jpeg","id":"9A6DD3BC-1B81-4FC4-9688-BF04C3FCEB45","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"操夢","duration":3.5,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"すると、レミリアが話しかけてくる。","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_035_博麗霊夢.wav","slideTitle":"第35スライド","voiceDuration":2.7094784580498867,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 35","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.035.jpeg","id":"08DAF74B-C641-48EB-8D7A-AEAC559968DB","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","duration":3.5,"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","telop":"「ねぇ、この記事に出てくる、幻想郷って何なの？」","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_036_操夢.wav","slideTitle":"第36スライド","voiceDuration":7.556077097505669,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 36","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.036.jpeg","id":"8A9C985A-5B1E-4FCB-A31B-19DECAE3FAB9","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"操夢","duration":3.8000000000000003,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"僕は、彼女の質問には、答えずに、\n彼女たちが見ている画面をスクロールしていく。","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_037_操夢.wav","slideTitle":"第37スライド","voiceDuration":4.977823129251701,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 37","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.037.jpeg","id":"16D7761A-8341-4459-BB27-3FDDAF8468D7","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（驚く）.png","backgroundName":"咲夜（驚く）.png","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"操夢","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（驚く）.png","duration":3.5,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"すると、彼女たちは、驚いた表情する。","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_038_操夢.wav","slideTitle":"第38スライド","voiceDuration":8.10390022675737,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 38","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.038.jpeg","id":"639D5D79-3484-4094-BE28-20AB3E22DD8E","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"操夢","duration":5.300000000000001,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"「この記事は、幻想郷の地下深くを通るトンネルと、碓氷峠の地下を通るトンネルがつながったと記されています。」","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_039_操夢.wav","slideTitle":"第39スライド","voiceDuration":7.038684807256236,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 39","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.039.jpeg","id":"6BA04B6B-3190-49BC-AA4E-D9D5D4951F3D","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"操夢","duration":5.2,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"「そして、この記事には、奥羽リニア新幹線のトンネルとつながり、自由に行き来できるとも記載されています。」","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_040_操夢.wav","slideTitle":"第40スライド","voiceDuration":6.224557823129252,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 40","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.040.jpeg","id":"D3382F37-4B7E-4D51-BEB1-C1465964E925","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"操夢","duration":5.300000000000001,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"「そして、この記事の公開日は3人の猛者が組んでできたゆかりん党が結束した日の1ヶ月後に公開されています。」","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_041_操夢.wav","slideTitle":"第41スライド","voiceDuration":7.138684807256236,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 41","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.041.jpeg","id":"3D9C5B1B-60BE-4191-A539-7CA282017A06","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"操夢","duration":5.5,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"「実は、この記事の作者は、今僕が依頼した文さんで、おそらく、紫をはじめとしたゆかりん党と裏でつながってます。」","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_042_操夢.wav","slideTitle":"第42スライド","voiceDuration":7.895215419501134,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 42","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.042.jpeg","id":"CEDC9409-14EA-47B3-AC76-E52BA8F22294","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"操夢","duration":5.2,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"「その文さんが、その裏口を閉じて、紫さんたちを裏切ったと知れ渡れば、現内閣の崩壊は時間の問題でしょう。」","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_043_操夢.wav","slideTitle":"第43スライド","voiceDuration":7.532154195011338,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 43","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.043.jpeg","id":"3E2FA1D8-2982-40D9-AD55-A3E42C7F4D24","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","duration":3.5,"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","telop":"「もしかして、そこまであなたは考えて実行したの？」","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_044_操夢.wav","slideTitle":"第44スライド","voiceDuration":7.8691156462585035,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 44","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.044.jpeg","id":"DCFDDFD4-0FFD-48B8-B5E1-DB7F3D623946","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"操夢","duration":5.2,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"「その文さんが、その裏口を閉じて、紫さんたちを裏切ったと知れ渡れば、現内閣の崩壊は時間の問題でしょう。」","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_045_赤面.wav","slideTitle":"第45スライド","voiceDuration":9.27873015873016,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 45","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.045.jpeg","id":"E6FFBE8D-A6DC-4EC7-AF3F-5C54DFDD44CC","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","duration":3.5,"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","telop":"「じゃあ、紫たちは、このままだと…」","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_046_操夢.wav","slideTitle":"第46スライド","voiceDuration":6.238684807256236,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 46","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.046.jpeg","id":"13963920-6177-46F4-836C-CB8B750CBA8C","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜ごくり.png","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"操夢","duration":3.5,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"すると、彼女たちの表情が変わる。","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_047_操夢.wav","slideTitle":"第47スライド","voiceDuration":6.2365079365079366,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 47","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.047.jpeg","id":"CC554371-8D30-4372-936E-24FDE7EA1901","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜ごくり.png","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"操夢","duration":5.5,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"「僕は、政党を作ることはしません。だから内閣が崩壊しても、それは実質的なことで他者から見たら、変わりません。」","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_048_射命丸文.wav","slideTitle":"第48スライド","voiceDuration":4.443582766439909,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 48","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.048.jpeg","id":"09668C82-B7B4-4D00-B42B-16D8FADA58F6","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜ごくり.png","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"操夢","duration":4.800000000000001,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"「ですが、僕はこの国のシステムを直接操作、変更することで政党不要な新たな仕組みを築き上げます…」","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_049_操夢.wav","slideTitle":"第49スライド","voiceDuration":2.156077097505669,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 49","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.049.jpeg","id":"13BEF0CB-A282-4718-9839-3071C0EDB87D","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜ごくり.png","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"操夢","duration":4.9,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"「おそらく、僕の同胞がいるので、その人たちで丸ごとシステムを操ることで、実権を直接握り締めます…」","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_050_操夢.wav","slideTitle":"第50スライド","voiceDuration":2.673469387755102,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 50","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.050.jpeg","id":"A26FE743-1763-4ED5-B25E-A8DE93FE5B6D","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜ごくり.png","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"操夢","duration":5.4,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"「ですので、紫さんたちを魔理沙さんたちから見たときは、これまで通りの状態なので、気にする必要なないですよ…」","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_051_ナレーション.wav","slideTitle":"第51スライド","voiceDuration":1.4996371882086168,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 51","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.051.jpeg","id":"116AE0C5-73DA-4B2A-A80B-90D423EEC33C","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","duration":3.5,"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","telop":"「そう…」","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_052_操夢.wav","slideTitle":"第52スライド","voiceDuration":5.313673469387755,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 52","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.052.jpeg","id":"9874555D-4138-400F-AFC4-F30F0B3562F5","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"操夢","duration":5.800000000000001,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"すると、霊夢が部屋に戻ってくる。「とりあえず一通りの作業は済んだので、魔理沙さんたちは自由に行動して大丈夫ですよ。」","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_053_博麗霊夢.wav","slideTitle":"第53スライド","voiceDuration":1.6732426303854875,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 53","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.053.jpeg","id":"22D7DD20-7E26-472F-88B0-408650EB4E9A","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"博麗霊夢","duration":3.5,"audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","telop":"「えっと…私は…」","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_054_操夢.wav","slideTitle":"第54スライド","voiceDuration":6.116938775510204,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 54","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.054.jpeg","id":"AE06C0D1-50FB-45EC-8508-0471021A33A8","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"操夢","duration":4.800000000000001,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"「霊夢さんは過去の馬券の購入歴について、\n聞きたいことがありますから、僕とこの部屋に残りますよ。」","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_055_操夢.wav","slideTitle":"第55スライド","voiceDuration":9.564761904761905,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 55","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.055.jpeg","id":"66083716-8DAA-42A6-8085-483C65032FA8","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"咲夜困り顔.png","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/パチュリー（困る）.png","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"操夢","duration":4.9,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"僕はそういうと、霊夢の手を握り、こちらに引き寄せる。\n「魔理沙さんたちは自由に動いて大丈夫ですよ。」","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_056_操夢.wav","slideTitle":"第56スライド","voiceDuration":5.4321541950113374,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 56","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.056.jpeg","id":"C5D45F02-D59A-4875-91CF-CF3D6FB70DAF","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"操夢","duration":5.6000000000000005,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"僕がそういうと、雰囲気で察したのか、魔理沙たちは、部屋から出ていき、部屋に残ったのは僕と霊夢の二人だけになった。","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_057_操夢.wav","slideTitle":"第57スライド","voiceDuration":8.447369614512471,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 57","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.057.jpeg","id":"A616B8F7-7365-4E1E-A0A2-6383F4000512","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"操夢","duration":4.7,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"「さて、あなたがこれまで購入した馬券の内容と金額、購入日時について１から教えてもらいますか…」","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_058_操夢.wav","slideTitle":"第58スライド","voiceDuration":9.066938775510204,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 58","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.058.jpeg","id":"6D3E46CD-A305-42C6-AE54-90A7EAADE938","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"操夢","duration":3.6,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"「あと、働いている時の愚痴や不満があれば、\nここで一緒に述べてください。」","animationName":"なし"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_059_操夢.wav","slideTitle":"第59スライド","voiceDuration":5.545215419501134,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","title":"シーン 59","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.059.jpeg","id":"8D9B5F9F-C395-4992-84DB-FF5C2D81FBC2","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceCharacter":"操夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","characterName":"操夢","duration":4.5,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"それから、僕は彼女の馬券の購入履歴と内容、\n仕事に対する愚痴や不満と一つ一つ聞き取っていた。","animationName":"なし"},{"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","slideTitle":"第60スライド","title":"シーン 60","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.060.jpeg","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】